                <pb facs="0312" n="306" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg306"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Nicaraguan minister here is advised by his Government of an insurrection in
                    Mosquito participated in by Americans. Full and prompt report by you is
                    desirable.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
